<title>CHILE: Chile markets closed Friday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Chile markets closed Friday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's financial and stock markets are closed Friday for a public holiday.</p>
<p>The markets will re-open as usual Monday at 0930 local (1450 GMT).</p>
<p>((--Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212--))</p>
